uch from the sky.\n\n👥 IN TEAM \nOne pilot, two medics - or an entire squadron on a fire. Request to embark, share the mission and the bonus. Playing with friends pays off ","thumbs":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d694fc00757e6b6cbbcd0464455fdb38/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-10b7d78a3fd94fed6c010fce9651c5b5/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-9307477cfeea759e4a47bcb06b88fc6f/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter"]}